859178", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_889782137192511_3208280521748122547_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Y5G8FoJIhcQ7kNvwFXEww6&_nc_oc=AdpaYgan1xL4nOD-mpvGBI5tjQSr7fWOz6cYiM7VpzoEtWB0DTL9jeOY0KYfFE7AIME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5aTZIsiLW3airW9elP1fL7DqKtA3sXsXQzdjgA-nfWBg&oe=6A15A151"}, {"file_name": "NC_Screenshot_5.png", "id": "2124537351674027", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2124537355007360_5343553262709774232_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QplcdZ4Haz0Q7kNvwGpGQuu&_nc_oc=Adqi47192vQ0jKBa_SZgt9ImNH-gKOKKIxqCvP2OCHHi9Q-UKES0buvSu7Nqc48CeWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4cuiD-0tjuCJWHj5TigTWDKAD7OdIaSY9KqSY-4XBc2g&oe=6A15A10A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "NexusCalibration_MetaXR_SystemSplash.png", "id": "912975087886289", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_912975091219622_2607471327440046147_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lHX3c4mczHwQ7kNvwEm0Wis&_nc_oc=Adokb6Glshaa4SeXbmab3qpZj4qKLt5LBjUbMJeUQ3W1SjCaYZuTiZxiL8lYEAVX0is&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Nnw2Ag6ACBejIzPrmWqn_Qps9KZlRN_CK_H86c9S7aQ&oe=6A15A854"}, "display_name": "Nexus Calibration", "keywords": ["shooter", "tactical", "scifi", "drones", "action"], "long_description": "The mainframe is compromised, and you are the ultimate countermeasure. Welcome to NEXUS CALIBRATION, a physical VR shooter where your body is your best weapon. Set in a high-contrast metallic world, you must eradicate a rogue drone network.\n\nSurvival isn't enough; perfection is required. Our unique scoring system demands extreme accuracy. \n\nPhysical Combat Mastery:\n\nSnap your wrist downward to cool your weapon instantly.\n\nPunch your shield forward to parry incoming fire.\n\nPhysically grab your gun hand to eliminate recoil for sniper-like precision.\n\nEarly Access Protocol:\nWe are launching this polished Vertical Slice to validate our precision-based gameplay loop. This initial deployment includes:\n\n1 fully polished environment\n3 active difficulty settings to test your reflexes.\n\nYour Mission:\nPlay the game and provide vital feedback to help us  shape the game's future. Join the calibration process and help shape the roadmap!", "short_description": "Welcome to NEXUS CALIBRATION, an Early Access VR tactical shooter where precision is everything. Step into the physical Armory, grab your gear, and face off against relentless robotic drones. Master physical mechanics like wrist-flick weapon cooling, shield parrying, and braced aiming. Help us shape the ultimate VR combat experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nexus-calibration.netlify.app/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nexus-calibration.netlify.app/terms", "publisher_name": "Arigrad", "support_website_url": "https://nexus-calibration.netlify.app/support", "website_url": "https://nexus-calibration.netlify.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25875734145388955"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "970227379092943"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1844827329510556"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1844827329510556"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1779123600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "970227379092943"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26532609963034700", "version": "0.5700"}, "id": "1379251863954236", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25875734128722290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26532609963034700"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1379251863954236"}]}, "change_log": "**v0.5700 \u2014 Byte by byte**\n\n\ufffd **Feature**\n\u2022 **Enemy Drones Hull Damage** \u2014 Enemies taking hit will now display damagge on their hull, revealing inner damage\n\u2022 **Player Shield Reactive additions** \u2014 Shield will now show visible motion when taking hit, display accurate damage  and improved vfx\n\u2022 **Player Hit Reaction UI** \u2014 Player should be notified by a UI change when getting hit, maybe also a SFX\n\u2022 **Player Weapon accurate Tracer added** \u2014 even though the weapon is a \\\"hitscan\\\", it needed a visual feedback for shots\n\n\ufffd **Fix**\n\u2022 **Laser line need to be removed when game starts** \u2014 remove it from shooting levels\n\u2022 **Health and Shield HP works but player wont die fast enough** \u2014 systems are working just needs adjustments, also drone spawner needs to be ready for rebooting level when user dies from health\n\u2022 **Increase Enemy Hit Reactions** \u2014 Enemies look like less reactive when taking hits as they should\n\u2022 **Drones per diffuculty retain stats** \u2014 Drones should have more changes initiating when difficulty changes, even on the fly.\n\u2022 **Weapon Drop issue** \u2014 Weapon drop when blocked from certain Distance\n\n\ufffd **Improvement**\n\u2022 **Rework tutorial monitor** \u2014 add mesh and buttons, should know when it triggers, also fetch from net, not from storage\n\u2022 **Handgun vertical Recoil removal** \u2014 Handguns vertical recoil removed completely as it was quite jittery for fun gunplay\n\u2022 **Improve the Enemies Projectiles** \u2014 Complete rework of the visuals\n\u2022 **Drones Weakpoint reaction** \u2014 Drones weakpoints \\\"flash\\\" with current color when get hit\n\n\ufffd **Overhaul**\n\u2022 **Complete revamp of save/load system** \u2014 robust and future proof\n\n\ufffd **Balance**\n\u2022 **Enemies dont take much damage** \u2014 +50% damage added to handguns\n\n\ufffd **UI**\n\u2022 **Quest UI graphics option Performance and Battery mode** \u2014 have this as an option to less advanced users.\n\u2022 **Selecting a level/difficulty streamlined** \u2014 its confusing to select those and then got to teleporter, its not really clear\n\u2022 **Many UI menu choices or radio button wont keep the selections** \u2014 its a visual bug needs to be addressed\n\u2022 **Add SnapTurn/ Teleport Options** \u2014 Extensive control of the controls on the options controls ui menus\n\u2022 **\\\"Main Menu\\\" and \\\"back\\\" buttons ovelaping** \u2014 scaling issue with ui, relocation is needed\n\u2022 **double button click sounds** \u2014 button play twice the click sound\n\n\ufffd **SFX**\n\u2022 **Improve Handgun SFX** \u2014 sound fx for handgun are a bit soft, should be deeper and bassier\n\u2022 **Weapon distinct Overheat SFX** \u2014 A more distinct SFX for overheating\n\n\ufffd **VFX**\n\u2022 **Dead drones vfx** \u2014 dead drones should have explosion / vanish vfx added\n\u2022 **Add parts thrown away VFX when Drones take hits** \u2014 There should be drones parts falling when they take hits", "created_date": 1777231843, "id": "26532609963034700", "version": "0.5700", "version_code": 54, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25875734128722290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26532609963034700"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1776873208, "id": "26481174398178257", "version": "0.52", "version_code": 28, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25875734128722290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26532609963034700"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1379251863954236"}]}, "change_log": "## [0.52.0] - 2026-03-29\n\n### Added\n- PlayerShield SFX\n- Global + Meta Graphics + Save\n- Seated Mode toggle mapped to the Left Controller's \"Y\" Button\n- Reflected/parried enemy projectiles now stun drones for a brief time\n- Automatic detection and prompting for toggling Seated Mode\n\n### Changed\n- Weapon rotation alignment pitched to -20 degrees to improve ergonomic wrist stretching\n- APK filesize significantly reduced\n\n### Fixed\n- Losing the Player Slot when returning to the Hub", "created_date": 1774786097, "id": "26226830566945976", "version": "0.52", "version_code": 25, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25875734128722290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26532609963034700"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1379251863954236"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1774473656, "id": "26187471387548561", "version": "0.513", "version_code": 22, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25875734128722290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26532609963034700"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1379251863954236"}]}, "change_log": "Update 0.510\n- BUG FIX : Enemy drones critical bug preventing spawning\n- BALANCING : Basic Handgun and shield balancing\n- STORAGE : Decreased APK size\n- MUSIC : Added Action paced themed music scores for shooting levels\n- SFX : Added / Improved / Changed ALL SFX ACROSS THE BOARD", "created_date": 1774283239, "id": "26164055529890147", "version": "0.51", "version_code": 21, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}